OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after three injured
OL,4,Ain stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 46-year-old man has been arrested
OL,7,Ffollowing a stabbing in which three
OL,8,Fpeople were injured in Borough Green.
OL,10,FKent Police said armed officers were
OL,11,Fcalled to a property in Sevenoaks Road,
OL,12,Fat about 07:40 BST on Thursday,
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of a domestic
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,FOne man was taken to a London hospital
OL,17,Fwith injuries described as
OL,18,Flife-changing. A second man was taken
OL,19,Fto a local hospital, while a woman
OL,20,Fsustained minor arm injuries, the force
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
