OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after three injured
OL,4,Ain stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe suspect was arrested at 18:25 in
OL,7,FWalworth Road, London, and is in
OL,8,Fcustody while inquiries continue,
OL,9,Fpolice said.
